{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"35525","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v24510","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"健康 クロス","creatorId":"vndb:s17248","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17248","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17248","name":"健康 クロス","roleCode":"art","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:152938","source":"vndb"}],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"exet","creatorId":"vndb:s13384","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13384","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13384","name":"exet","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:152937","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"健康 クロス","creatorId":"vndb:s17248","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17248","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17248","name":"健康 クロス","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:152939","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c76089","characterName":"Succubus Eristia","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c76089"},"originalCharacterName":"Succubus Eristia","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Succubus Family, Demon Type"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"\"Screw the order's teaching and the duties of a hero. Those things only make us unhappy. Succumb to the darkness, release your desire, and be joined with the person you love...That is the greatest happiness in this world\""},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After the fall of Lescatie, the hero Eristia remained loyal to the remnant of the order's forces until the very end, but she was monsterized by the \"Magic sword of Truth\", resulting in this form. Her once frigid personality has changed into a lively and passionate one due to her transformation into a succubus. Devoted to her own desire, having obscene, licentious intercourse with the lover to whom she is joined is her greatest happiness."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She has not been directly blessed by the hand of Druelia, and yet perhaps because the sword which served as a catalyst had stored up a high concentration of mamono mana, she appears just as though she had been. And along with that, she revers her as her master and the \"embodiment of her ideals\", appearing to be fiercely loyal."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Ever since she, along with other monsters, attacked and destroyed the order encampment to which she formerly belonged, she hasn't made any movements that stand out, but just like Druella and the other ex-heroes under her command, in the event that \"Mamono Realm State Lescatie\" were to resume the invasion, it is predicted that she will become a noteworthy threat."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76089"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc6c02c07e423875125b64d016ff53710d4aef29a9430fbe44865e71aa04528d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/40a4ecb33975085844b60917d9e86c8a4fd72ee1b5ee822c33486c34d12f06c0.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c76140","characterName":"リーア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c76140"},"originalCharacterName":"リーア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p7098","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:5621","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7098","name":"サークル・エクセルガ","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","re